{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soulkin is a tactical, Roguelite game that blends strategic monster-collecting with turn-based combat. As the summoned heroine, Nadia, you\u2019ll harness the power of Souls to bond with magical creatures and lead them against the encroaching corruption threatening Ankiril.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This mystical world, anchored around a colossal tree, teems with magical creatures known as Soulkin, each infused with the power of elements. Will you rise to the challenge and become the savior of Ankiril?\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Strategic.png?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Battle.gif?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in turn-based battles that require tactical positioning and clever use of your Soulkin\u2019 abilities. Adapt your tactics to overcome formidable foes and environmental challenges on a hexagonal grid.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Join.png?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/team.gif?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from multiple Soulkin squads and Nadia variants, each boasting distinct elemental strengths and playstyles. As you complete objectives, you\u2019ll unlock new squads, additional power-ups, and stronger abilities. Strategically choose and enhance your squad to confront Ankiril\u2019s ever-growing threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Challenging.png?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Challenging.gif?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through challenging encounters and unlock new events, bonuses, and increased stats. Your journey will be difficult, but the rewards are plentiful for those who persevere.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Dynamic.png?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Dynamic.gif?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each chapter offers a fresh and unique gameplay experience with dynamic maps, battles, and events. This ensures varied and exciting playthroughs every time, keeping the gameplay engaging and unpredictable.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Wishlist_Banner.png?t=1744902325\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tide of Fury Stilled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849070/b9c149379ad0baf92a4fe35d07d799d676151ed1.jpg"},{"name":"Venom Crown Broken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849070/b8c8a67c93957850e1163e1d14229b9e2ea9f5e0.jpg"},{"name":"The Spell Is Broken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849070/6ce7bbe5e7e3a187195b76b5931357a7c5e7b897.jpg"},{"name":"The Flame Submits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849070/245c918eac2162566d653c4b583a277a93abeef1.jpg"},{"name":"The Reluctant King Falls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849070/03301dd5bde1bcb3c4dd3b5fb6f0c7c9a89f6a1d.jpg"},{"name":"Feathers Like Blades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849070/e7c27b802821ac600f1a04dd7713836b54ebb7ce.jpg"},{"name":"Soulbound","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849070/47c01b782471f67b0a13ff12a70498c26128d8ee.jpg"},{"name":"Resonant Echoes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849070/4974b56b1ab1e5eca1c02af4c0890d1e58082e53.jpg"},{"name":"Soulkeeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849070/61a38c4c271f794004ee2afd0e8c03be38629f83.jpg"},{"name":"Tethered Depths","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2849070/def026133525b3e72d6ed6fdf454cd1dc1bf3e08.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2849070?t=1744902325","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744902325","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/0eddb4d43e7131a8a37693726183d6e05a9058e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744902325","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/0eddb4d43e7131a8a37693726183d6e05a9058e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744902325","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3006570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soulkin is a tactical, Roguelite game that blends strategic monster-collecting with turn-based combat. As the summoned heroine, Nadia, you\u2019ll harness the power of Souls to bond with magical creatures and lead them against the encroaching corruption threatening Ankiril.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This mystical world, anchored around a colossal tree, teems with magical creatures known as Soulkin, each infused with the power of elements. Will you rise to the challenge and become the savior of Ankiril?\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Strategic.png?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Battle.gif?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in turn-based battles that require tactical positioning and clever use of your Soulkin\u2019 abilities. Adapt your tactics to overcome formidable foes and environmental challenges on a hexagonal grid.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Join.png?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/team.gif?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select from multiple Soulkin squads and Nadia variants, each boasting distinct elemental strengths and playstyles. As you complete objectives, you\u2019ll unlock new squads, additional power-ups, and stronger abilities. Strategically choose and enhance your squad to confront Ankiril\u2019s ever-growing threats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2849070/extras/Challenging.png?t=1744902325\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\